{"strongs": "H8050", "word": "שְׁמוּאֵל", "translit": "she.mu.el", "root": "שלש", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Samuel", "definition": "שְׁמוּאֵל 140 proper name, masculine Samuel (= name of El Thes and others (or, his name is El Hom Heb.Trad.98f. Wkl KAT 3. 225 Now 181, 20), compare פּנוּאֵל , רְעוּאֵל ; see Dr 181, 20 ; Prät ZMG 1903, 777 ff. caritative from יִשְׁמָעֵאל ; Palmyrene שמואל Lzb 377 ; see further Gie AT Schätzung d. Gottesn. (1901), 102 ff. ); — 1. great prophet, 11th cent. B.C., σαμουηλ : 1Sam 1:20 (name explained as if from שָׁאַל ), 1Sam 1:18 ; 1Sam 1:21 ; 1Sam 1:26 + 125 t. 1 Samuel; 1Chr 6:13 ; 1Chr 6:18 ; 1Chr 9:22 ; 1Chr 11:3 ; 1Chr 26:28 ; 1Chr 29:29 ; 1Chr 2:18 ; Ps 99:6 . 2. in Simeon, Num 34:30 ( P ), σαλαμιηλ . 3. in Issachar 1Chr 7:2 , (I) σαμουηλ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8779')\">BDB8779</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H8050')\">H8050</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8778')\">BDB8778</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB8780')\">BDB8780</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>שְׁמוּאֵל</bdbheb><sub>140</sub> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <highlightword>Samuel</highlightword> (= <highlight>name of El</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Thes')\">Thes</lookup> and others (or, <highlight>his name is El</highlight> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Hom')\">Hom<sup>Heb.Trad.98f.</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Wkl')\">Wkl<sup>KAT 3. 225</sup></lookup> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Now')\">Now</lookup> 181, 20), compare <bdbheb>פּנוּאֵל</bdbheb>, <bdbheb>רְעוּאֵל</bdbheb>; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Dr')\">Dr<sup>181, 20</sup></lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Prä')\">Prät<sup>ZMG 1903, 777 ff.</sup></lookup> caritative from <bdbheb>יִשְׁמָעֵאל</bdbheb>; Palmyrene <bdbheb>שמואל</bdbheb> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ldzb')\">Lzb<sup>377</sup></lookup>; see further <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Gie')\">Gie<sup>AT Schätzung d. Gottesn. (1901), 102 ff.</su